  "prompt": "Voltmarkt's pricing team reports revenue for April to June 2025 by promotion type, with the lines that had no promotion (order_lines.promo_id is missing) under 'none'. Before the report goes out, check that it adds up. Revenue is quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur, and a line's month is the UTC month of its order's order_ts, as sales.order_month gives it. For each month, return four columns, in this order: month (its first day), report_revenue (the report's revenue over every promotion type, 'none' included), sales_revenue (net_revenue_eur in sales) and difference (report_revenue minus sales_revenue). Return one row for each month. Any row order is fine.",
